  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Crowdfunding Guarantee Legal Opinion 2017</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Crowdfunding Guarantee Legal Opinion 2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A lawyer with experience of Sida&apos;s guarantee scheme, in collaboration with Sida&apos;s internal lawyers
and administrators review the legal framework within which International Crowdfunding
Platforms seem and assess and propose arrangements for a guarantee structure consistent with
Sida&apos;s guarantee arrangement and draft draft agreements.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Jurist med erfarenhet av Sidas garantif&#xf6;rordning skall i samverkan med Sidas interna jurister
och handl&#xe4;ggare granska det legala ramverk inom vilket internationella Crowdfunding
Platformar verkar och bed&#xf6;ma och f&#xf6;resl&#xe5; uppl&#xe4;gg f&#xf6;r en garantistruktur som &#xe4;r f&#xf6;renlig med
Sidas garantif&#xf6;rordning samt utarbeta avtalsutkast.</narrative>
  </description>
